body:
Hi there!

After a bit more investigation, I found a trick that fixes the issue for my specific case, but I guess will be breaking widgets in SSR:

```tsx
// instantsearch/packages/react-instantsearch-nextjs/src/InstantSearchNext.tsx
...
  return (
    <ServerOrHydrationProvider
      isServer={isServer}
      instance={instance}
      ignoreMultipleHooksWarning={ignoreMultipleHooksWarning}
    >
      <InstantSearch {...instantSearchProps} routing={routing!}>
        {/* Commenting this line stops the loop (obviously, as it is the cause...) */}
        {/* isServer && <InitializePromise nonce={nonce} /> */}
        {children}
        {isServer && <TriggerSearch nonce={nonce} />}
      </InstantSearch>
    </ServerOrHydrationProvider>
  );
}
```

I realised I am not adding much to the conversation, but in the end, it is clear that the issue is isolated in that `InitializePromise` component.

So far I was not able to really understand 100% what it does, and therefore I was not able to debug and try to fix it. Claude was not able either, so I commented the line and now my app *kind of* works.

I'll share more info whenever I can.
